{"seq":11,"slug":"databricks","title":"Databricks 企业文化与管理","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":29,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks","rating":{"composite":3.98,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":4}},"introMarkdown":"# Databricks 企业文化与管理 简介\n\nDatabricks 成立于 2013 年，由七位加州大学伯克利分校 AMPLab 实验室的研究者共同创立，是全球数据与人工智能领域最具影响力的企业之一。公司从开源项目 Apache Spark 起步，逐步构建了融合数据湖灵活性与数据仓库可靠性的 Lakehouse 架构，服务于全球超过两万家组织，其中包括超过 60% 的财富 500 强企业。截至近期，Databricks 估值已达 1340 亿美元，年化营收突破 54 亿美元，成为全球估值最高的私营科技企业之一。\n\nDatabricks 的管理实践极具研究价值。它成功实现了从学术研究团队到万人规模商业企业的跨越，在开源社区贡献与商业盈利之间找到了独特的平衡点。其联合创始人兼 CEO Ali Ghodsi 将学术研究中\"追求真相\"的精神注入企业文化，形成了以工程驱动、第一性原理思考和客户至上为核心的管理体系。\n\n第一章**文化与价值观**探讨 Databricks 如何在开源理想与商业化之间建立平衡，以及学术创业基因如何塑造了公司的独特文化。第二章**绩效体系**分析其工程驱动的考核机制和产品与研究双轨发展模式。第三章**组织与人才**聚焦 Ali Ghodsi 的领导风格，以及公司从七人创始团队发展为万人企业的组织演变。第四章**战略与方法论**解读 Lakehouse 架构的战略意义、MosaicML 收购带来的 LLM 转型，以及 Unity Catalog 数据治理战略。\n\n理解 Databricks 的管理模式，对于研究学术创业商业化路径、开源软件企业的成长逻辑，以及数据与 AI 时代的企业战略选择，都具有重要的参考价值。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"open-source-commercial-balance","title":"Databricks 开源与商业化平衡策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/open-source-commercial-balance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"academic-startup-dna","title":"Databricks 学术创业基因解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/academic-startup-dna"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-democratization-mission","title":"Databricks 数据民主化使命","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/data-democratization-mission"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-evolution","title":"Databricks 使命与愿景演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/mission-vision-evolution"},{"seq":5,"slug":"ali-ghodsi-leadership-philosophy","title":"Ali Ghodsi 的领导理念与企业文化基因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/ali-ghodsi-leadership-philosophy"},{"seq":6,"slug":"open-source-strategy-practice","title":"开源与商业化的价值观平衡实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/open-source-strategy-practice"},{"seq":7,"slug":"data-democratization-in-practice","title":"数据民主化理念在产品和决策中的体现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/culture-and-values/data-democratization-in-practice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering-driven-evaluation","title":"Databricks 工程驱动考核体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/performance-system/engineering-driven-evaluation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"research-product-dual-track","title":"Databricks 研究与产品双轨体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/performance-system/research-product-dual-track"},{"seq":3,"slug":"growth-metrics-culture","title":"Databricks 增长指标文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/performance-system/growth-metrics-culture"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ali-ghodsi-leadership","title":"Ali Ghodsi 领导风格解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/org-and-talent/ali-ghodsi-leadership"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spark-team-to-enterprise","title":"从 Spark 团队到万人企业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/org-and-talent/spark-team-to-enterprise"},{"seq":3,"slug":"talent-acquisition-retention","title":"Databricks 人才获取与留任策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/databricks/org-and-talent/talent-acquisition-retention"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodolog